# Weekly school timetable on one landscape A4 page (Paper: A4 and Orientation: landscape, 297 × 210 mm): a table with
# the cells separated by a Gap, an hour cell on the left, subjects with their color, and break and lunch
# bands that span the five days with Span, a legend in a Stack with a line break
# and some notes in Markdown. Each color is a style in styles.stxt.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Orientation: landscape
		Margin: 40 46 46 46
	Title: Class 2B timetable · School year 2025-26
	Language: en
